{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-64921","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123750","text":"Collapsing the docs atlas onto one canonical host"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64923","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123751","text":"## ⚠ NOT ADOPTED — decided against 2026-08-13, the same day this was written.  This document was written to execute "},{"id":"spn-123752","marks":["code"],"text":"ACADEMY.md"},{"id":"spn-123753","text":" step A1b as that step was worded. Measuring the premise afterwards showed the step was asserting a "},{"id":"spn-123754","marks":["bold"],"text":"mechanism"},{"id":"spn-123755","text":" (301s exist) rather than the "},{"id":"spn-123756","marks":["bold"],"text":"outcome"},{"id":"spn-123757","text":" it wanted (one host accumulates the citations) — and the outcome already holds without any redirect:  - every page on all twelve non-canonical hosts declares "},{"id":"spn-123758","marks":["code"],"text":"canonical → docs.ampersandboxdesign.com"},{"id":"spn-123759","text":" - the sitemap they serve lists "},{"id":"spn-123760","marks":["bold"],"text":"only"},{"id":"spn-123761","text":" canonical-host URLs — they do not advertise themselves - their "},{"id":"spn-123762","marks":["code"],"text":"robots.txt"},{"id":"spn-123763","text":" points its "},{"id":"spn-123764","marks":["code"],"text":"Sitemap:"},{"id":"spn-123765","text":" line at the canonical host - "},{"id":"spn-123766","marks":["bold"],"text":"nothing links to them."},{"id":"spn-123767","text":" The shared nav links the canonical host 34×; across every marketing   site it is the only docs link  Unlinked, unsitemapped and self-declaring as copies, the twelve are effectively undiscoverable, and an engine that does reach one consolidates it. Buying that with twelve permanent edge rules — whose failure mode is a loop that takes the atlas down on all thirteen hostnames at once — is a bad trade.  "},{"id":"spn-123768","marks":["bold"],"text":"Everything below is retained deliberately, not by neglect."},{"id":"spn-123769","text":" If the decision is revisited, the configuration is here and the reasoning does not have to be re-derived. "},{"id":"spn-123770","marks":["code"],"text":"verify-canonical.sh"},{"id":"spn-123771","text":" still works and still exits 1, which is now the "},{"id":"spn-123772","marks":["italic"],"text":"expected"},{"id":"spn-123773","text":" result rather than a pending task.  The live question A1b leaves behind is not a redirect: "},{"id":"spn-123774","marks":["bold"],"text":"why are twelve unused custom domains attached to the Pages project?"},{"id":"spn-123775","text":" Detaching them dissolves the question entirely."}]}],"id":"blk-64922","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-64924","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123776","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-123777","text":" written 2026-08-13, "},{"id":"spn-123778","marks":["bold"],"text":"not applied and not planned"},{"id":"spn-123779","text":". "},{"id":"spn-123780","marks":["bold"],"text":"Supersedes:"},{"id":"spn-123781","text":" nothing. "},{"id":"spn-123782","marks":["bold"],"text":"Superseded by:"},{"id":"spn-123783","text":" the measurement above."}]},{"id":"blk-64925","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123784","text":"The "},{"id":"spn-123785","marks":["code"],"text":"docs"},{"id":"spn-123786","text":" Cloudflare Pages project has thirteen custom domains attached. All thirteen serve byte-identical content at HTTP 200, so 434 documents are published at roughly 5,600 URLs. Every page already declares "},{"id":"spn-123787","marks":["code"],"text":"<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/…\">"},{"id":"spn-123788","text":"; what is missing is enforcement."}]},{"id":"blk-64926","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123789","text":"This cannot be done from the repository. Cloudflare Pages' "},{"id":"spn-123790","marks":["code"],"text":"_redirects"},{"id":"spn-123791","text":" matches paths, not hostnames, and all thirteen domains are served by one deployment — so a "},{"id":"spn-123792","marks":["code"],"text":"_redirects"},{"id":"spn-123793","text":" entry would fire on the canonical host too. It has to be done at the edge."}]},{"id":"blk-64927","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123794","text":"Option A — one Bulk Redirect list (recommended)"}]},{"id":"blk-64928","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123795","text":"Account-level, so twelve hostnames are configured in one place rather than twelve."}]},{"id":"blk-64929","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123796","marks":["bold"],"text":"Dashboard →"},{"id":"spn-123797","text":" Account Home → Bulk Redirects → Create a redirect list → name it "},{"id":"spn-123798","marks":["code"],"text":"docs-canonical"},{"id":"spn-123799","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-64930","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123800","text":"For each row below: "},{"id":"spn-123801","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status `301`"},{"id":"spn-123802","text":", and enable "},{"id":"spn-123803","marks":["bold"],"text":"Preserve query string"},{"id":"spn-123804","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123805","marks":["bold"],"text":"Subpath matching"},{"id":"spn-123806","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-123807","marks":["bold"],"text":"Preserve path suffix"},{"id":"spn-123808","text":". Leave "},{"id":"spn-123809","marks":["italic"],"text":"Include subdomains"},{"id":"spn-123810","text":" off."}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-64932","spans":[{"id":"spn-123811","text":"Source URL"}]},{"id":"blk-64933","spans":[{"id":"spn-123812","text":"Target URL"}]}],"id":"blk-64931","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-64934","spans":[{"id":"spn-123813","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.agentelic.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-64935","spans":[{"id":"spn-123814","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64936","spans":[{"id":"spn-123815","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.agentromatic.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-64937","spans":[{"id":"spn-123816","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64938","spans":[{"id":"spn-123817","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.bendscript.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-64939","spans":[{"id":"spn-123818","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64940","spans":[{"id":"spn-123819","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.delegatic.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-64941","spans":[{"id":"spn-123820","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64942","spans":[{"id":"spn-123821","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.deliberatic.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-64943","spans":[{"id":"spn-123822","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64944","spans":[{"id":"spn-123823","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.fleetprompt.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-64945","spans":[{"id":"spn-123824","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64946","spans":[{"id":"spn-123825","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.geofleetic.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-64947","spans":[{"id":"spn-123826","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64948","spans":[{"id":"spn-123827","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.graphonomous.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-64949","spans":[{"id":"spn-123828","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64950","spans":[{"id":"spn-123829","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.opensentience.org/"}]},{"id":"blk-64951","spans":[{"id":"spn-123830","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64952","spans":[{"id":"spn-123831","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.specprompt.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-64953","spans":[{"id":"spn-123832","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64954","spans":[{"id":"spn-123833","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.ticktickclock.com/"}]},{"id":"blk-64955","spans":[{"id":"spn-123834","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}],[{"id":"blk-64956","spans":[{"id":"spn-123835","marks":["code"],"text":"docs.webhost.systems/"}]},{"id":"blk-64957","spans":[{"id":"spn-123836","marks":["code"],"text":"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com/"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-64958","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123837","text":"Then Bulk Redirects → Create rule → attach the "},{"id":"spn-123838","marks":["code"],"text":"docs-canonical"},{"id":"spn-123839","text":" list → Deploy."}]},{"id":"blk-64959","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123840","marks":["bold"],"text":"`docs.ampersandboxdesign.com` must NOT appear in that list."},{"id":"spn-123841","text":" Adding it produces a redirect loop that takes the atlas down on every host at once."}]},{"id":"blk-64960","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123842","text":"Option B — twelve Redirect Rules, one per zone"}]},{"id":"blk-64961","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123843","text":"Use this if Bulk Redirects is unavailable. In each of the twelve zones: "},{"id":"spn-123844","marks":["bold"],"text":"Rules → Redirect Rules → Create rule"},{"id":"spn-123845","text":", named "},{"id":"spn-123846","marks":["code"],"text":"docs → canonical"},{"id":"spn-123847","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-64962","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64964","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123848","marks":["bold"],"text":"When incoming requests match"},{"id":"spn-123849","text":" — Custom filter expression:"}]}],"id":"blk-64963","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-64965","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123850","text":"``"},{"id":"spn-123851","marks":["code"],"text":" (http.host eq \"docs.<ZONE>\") "},{"id":"spn-123852","text":"``"}]},{"id":"blk-64966","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64968","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123853","marks":["bold"],"text":"Then"},{"id":"spn-123854","text":" — Type "},{"id":"spn-123855","marks":["bold"],"text":"Dynamic"},{"id":"spn-123856","text":", Expression:"}]}],"id":"blk-64967","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-64969","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123857","text":"``"},{"id":"spn-123858","marks":["code"],"text":" concat(\"https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com\", http.request.uri.path) "},{"id":"spn-123859","text":"``"}]},{"id":"blk-64970","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-64972","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123860","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status code"},{"id":"spn-123861","text":" "},{"id":"spn-123862","marks":["code"],"text":"301"},{"id":"spn-123863","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123864","marks":["bold"],"text":"Preserve query string"},{"id":"spn-123865","text":" on."}]}],"id":"blk-64971","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-64973","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123866","text":"Substitute "},{"id":"spn-123867","marks":["code"],"text":"<ZONE>"},{"id":"spn-123868","text":" per zone: "},{"id":"spn-123869","marks":["code"],"text":"agentelic.com"},{"id":"spn-123870","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123871","marks":["code"],"text":"agentromatic.com"},{"id":"spn-123872","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123873","marks":["code"],"text":"bendscript.com"},{"id":"spn-123874","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123875","marks":["code"],"text":"delegatic.com"},{"id":"spn-123876","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123877","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberatic.com"},{"id":"spn-123878","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123879","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com"},{"id":"spn-123880","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123881","marks":["code"],"text":"geofleetic.com"},{"id":"spn-123882","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123883","marks":["code"],"text":"graphonomous.com"},{"id":"spn-123884","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123885","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org"},{"id":"spn-123886","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123887","marks":["code"],"text":"specprompt.com"},{"id":"spn-123888","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123889","marks":["code"],"text":"ticktickclock.com"},{"id":"spn-123890","text":", "},{"id":"spn-123891","marks":["code"],"text":"webhost.systems"},{"id":"spn-123892","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-64974","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123893","text":"Verify"}]},{"id":"blk-64975","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123894","text":"Run this after applying. It asserts that all twelve redirect and that the canonical host does "},{"id":"spn-123895","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-123896","text":" — a loop is the one failure mode that matters here, and it is the one a spot-check of a single host will miss."}]},{"id":"blk-64976","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"bash verify-canonical.sh          # from this repo\n# bash docs/verify-canonical.sh   # from the ProjectAmp2 working tree"},{"id":"blk-64977","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-123897","text":"Why 301 and not just the canonical tag"}]},{"id":"blk-64978","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-123898","text":"The canonical tag is a hint an engine may weigh; a 301 is a directive it must follow. Alkeyword's own G10 vocabulary rates this duplicate group as "},{"id":"spn-123899","marks":["bold"],"text":"agree"},{"id":"spn-123900","text":" — every URL naming the same original — which is the mildest form of the problem and the reason this sat unnoticed. It is still twelve copies of the corpus competing for the same citations, and Academy's Layer 1 thesis is that grounded, canonical, extractable pages get cited. Publishing that corpus thirteen times is the opposite of the argument the corpus is making."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierajqjqssxcvty34clgayovic3qqbl2r73ljaozyy4vtnrdysrr6rka","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}